      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KING'S DUTY (5) is in red-hot touch after successive wins at this track, the latest a BM68 where he was held up leaving the 400m yet still got there in time to pay her supporters. His record with Satherley is excellent, he gets weight relief and his 1400m profile is solid. Hat-trick inbound. AZTEC STATE (1) only warmed late in his stable debut off a long break over a trip far short of his best. Is sure to have come on from that and will relish stretching out the extra 300m. Just has to carry the big weight and he'll be in the finish. TIZSO FAB (3) is yet to fire this prep but his record over this track and trip keeps him firmly in the mix. CASH ARTIST (6) won't get a better chance to feature.",
